<section image-layout="blank" id="DRRlAou9Jr" background-color="heading"><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="YhA-KQEVze" vertical-align="center" colspan="38"><p role="eyebrow">Closing interpretation</p><h1 font-size="38pt">What the poem carries forward</h1><p font-size="18pt">Form and meaning meet in a shared logic of continuation.</p><grid direction="vertical" spacing="none" marker="symbol" marker-label="→" marker-position="inline" marker-style="solid" marker-shape="circle" marker-size="small" vertical-sizing="hug"><grid-item padding="10pt 0"><p font-size="18pt"><b>Sound.</b> Rhyme carries one line into the next.</p></grid-item><grid-item padding="10pt 0"><p font-size="18pt"><b>Consequence.</b> Choices carry effects beyond the moment of choosing.</p></grid-item><grid-item padding="10pt 0"><p font-size="18pt"><b>Judgment.</b> Survival carries dignity beyond injury—not beyond memory.</p></grid-item></grid><hr color="accent" thickness="md" width="xs"><h3 role="subheading">Read the reunion as continuation, not reset.</h3></grid-item><grid-item id="ozaN15RCxl" padding="0" colspan="22"><img src="https://cdn-staging.gamma.app/QWjS6fBfpt/generated-images/Xw3OzZq3eNb1c4oO4GJcZ.png" saved-media-id="zqbqzwskt4eoc45" source="image.ai-generated" fill="true" image-style="vietnamese-manuscript-editorial" alt="Ink-and-opaque-pigment editorial illustration on warm dó-paper-like fibers, a small boat at dawn crossing from a shadowed river gate into open water, its wake continuing beyond the right edge of the frame, Vietnamese manuscript and woodblock sensibility, lampblack, muted old gold and indigo with restrained vermilion accents, no text or lettering" meta="{&quot;width&quot;:1248,&quot;height&quot;:1664}"></grid-item></grid><shape preset="line" x="56" y="486" w="904" h="2" stroke="accent" stroke-width="3"></shape></section>